OL,3,GNEWSAHouse repairs reveal 'nationally
OL,4,Asignificant' features
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Nationally significant" wall paintings
OL,7,Fand medieval doorways have been
OL,8,Frevealed during the restoration of a
OL,9,FGrade II listed home.
OL,11,FPriory House in Dunstable,
OL,12,FBedfordshire, has undergone #1.82m of
OL,13,Frepairs since 2022, funded by grants
OL,14,Ffrom the National Lottery Heritage Fund
OL,15,Fand Historic England.
OL,17,FThe work has uncovered traces of 16th
OL,18,Fand 17th Century wall paintings, while
OL,19,Fcarbon dating found its vaulted
OL,20,Fceilings dated from the 13th Century.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
